# Do not hand-edit (normal PRs)

- **`CHANGELOG.md`** — updated by **python-semantic-release** on `main` ( insertion marker `<!-- version list -->` ).
- **`pyproject.toml` `version`** — bumped only by the release workflow / semantic-release.
- **`syncbot/requirements.txt`**, **`infra/aws/db_setup/requirements.txt`** — generated via `poetry export` / pre-commit hook from `pyproject.toml`.
- **Secrets** — never commit `.env`, `.env.deploy.*` with real values; only `*.example` templates belong in git.

If you must fix a release tooling bug, change config/workflows/docs — not fake “manual” version bumps in the files above.
